      },
      "semantics": "The media type recorded for the part, as a type and subtype with optional parameters whose quoted values are printable ASCII. Omitting it leaves the part's type undeclared, which the encoder writes as application/octet-stream; a supplied value becomes the staged copy's type, which FormData lowercases when it wraps the blob as a File.",
